DROP	nn-goog-a / nn-goog-c / nn-goog-d	(3 items)	200 OK — NOT really discarded, renamed. Downloaded under placeholder short names because archive.org gives all five Google-digitised Notes on Nursing scans a bogus date of 1969 ("update forthcoming"). Each title leaf was read to get the true year, then each was renamed: 1898, 1860 (a fourth scan of the first American edition), 1912. Kept, and in the ledger under those names.
